  "ruleText": "Res 5801.05 Previous Offenses. If a person has not committed the same offense in 7 years, the next offense shall be considered as a first offense.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading Res 5200) #6207, eff 3-21-96, EXPIRED: 3-21-04\n\nNew. #8094, INTERIM, eff 6-4-04, EXPIRED: 12-1-04\n\nNew. #8318, EMERGENCY, eff 4-4-05, EXPIRES: 10-1-05; ss by #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
